["Dropping the Bomb"]={description="Caskets containing gunpowder intended for a critical blasting operation have been lost in transit. With his soldiers apparently a bunch of hopeless cravens, Veit requires that you retrieve the caskets, which were last seen being dumped into the river.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="3",id=55,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=2954,name="Powder Casket"}},reward="1,200 Cruor\nVersa Breeches with random  Augments",start_npc="Veit (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Misareaux"},
["Emissaries of God"]={description="The enigmatic caturae are suspected to hold the key to gaining access to Al'Taieu, the celestial capital. Defeat all six known species, that the door to salvation might be cast opened!",fame="Abyssea",id=182,next={"Beneath a Blood-red Sky"},previous={"Death and Rebirth"},reward="Abyssite of discernment",start_npc="Esha'ntarl",start_zone="Hall of the Gods"},
["Explosive Endeavors"]={description="Swarms of monsters have been observed emerging from ominous crevices in the valley floor. Neutralize them with experimental anti-Abyssean grenades.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="3",id=5,repeatable="Yes",reward="240 Cruor",start_npc="Fontoumant (A), Abyssea",start_zone="La Theine"},
["Family Ties"]={description="A devoted Tarutaru father was separated from wife and child in their flight from Jeuno. Deliver his letter, that this loving family may be reunited once more.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="4",id=34,previous={"For Want of a Pot"},reward="Taru Tot Toyset\nOptional: Jester's Hat",start_npc="Teigero-Bangero, Abyssea",start_pos="E-7",start_zone="Vunkerl"},
["Fear of the Dark III"]={description="Fetch three clionid wings.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=2,repeatable="Yes",reward="200 Cruor",start_npc="Secodiand (A), Abyssea",start_zone="La Theine"},
["First Contact"]={description="At Joachim's behest, you must meet with a mystery man whose identity cannot yet be disclosed. Make your way to the stone circle in the La Theine Plateau at a time between dusk and dawn.",fame="Abyssea",id=167,next={"An Officer and a Pirate"},previous={"Dawn of Death","The Forbidden Frontier","Scars of Abyssea (Quest)","Heroes of Abyssea"},start_npc="Joachim",start_zone="Port Jeuno"},
["Flown the Coop"]={description="One of the precious few chocobos who survived the flight from Jeuno has escaped from the stables. Track the bird, lure it out with gysahl greens, and capture it to return to safe captivity.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="2",id=41,repeatable="Yes",reward="First time completion: [Key Item] Jade abyssite of prosperity\nSubsequent completions: 400 Cruor\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Head seals\nTantra Seal: Head (MNK)\nCreed Seal: Head (PLD)\nAoidos' Seal: Head (BRD)\nMavi Seal: Head (BLU)",start_npc="Brutus, Abyssea",start_pos="H-8",start_zone="Attohwa"},
["For Love of a Daughter"]={description="A distraught Mithran mother seeks your help in finding a cure for her fever-stricken daughter. The substance she requires is a rare liquid said to be exuded by cacti of the canyon, but only after dark...",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="3",id=26,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=1595,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Cup of Tahrongi cactus water"}},reward="First five completions:\n300 Cruor each completion\nSixth attempt at beginning the quest:\n[Key Item] Viridian abyssite of lenity",start_npc="Baha Mannohl, Abyssea",start_pos="H-4",start_zone="Tahrongi"},
["For Want of a Pot"]={description="You must retrieve Naruru's favorite stewpot from the airship wreckage so that she can cook up a batch of piping hot stew from...no, for her fellow survivors!",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="3",id=47,next={"Family Ties"},requirements={{count=1,id=1886,name="Sieglinde Putty"}},reward="Orblight",start_npc="Naruru, Abyssea",start_pos="G-10",start_zone="Attohwa"},
["Frozen Flame Redux"]={description="Following in the footsteps of his Crystal War veteran father, the enterprising Guilboire seeks to harness the power of snolls to strike back at the hordes. Travel to the test site and assist with data collection.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=75,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=1736,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Frosted snoll reflector"}},reward="10~600 Cruor for each completion, depending on the damage dealt from the explosion.\nChance at one of the following:\nBloody Bolt x10\nAcid Bolt x10\nSnoll Gelato\nChance of one of the following:\nBale Seal: Hands (DRK)\nMavi Seal: Hands (BLU)\nCaller's Seal: Hands (SMN)\nGoetia Seal: Hands (BLM)",start_npc="Guilboire (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Uleguerand"},
["Full-of-Himself Alchemist"]={description="Self-serving and abrasive though he may be, the alchemist Julio's estimable potion-brewing skills are serving the embattled resistance well. Supply him with three purple polypores, that he may prepare a new batch of his prized product for the wounded troops.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=13,next={"The Walking Wounded"},previous={"Rose on the Heath"},repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=3,id=5682,name="Purple Polypore"}},reward="Soothing Potion x2",start_npc="Julio, Abyssea",start_pos="F-10",start_zone="Konschtat"},
["Getting Lucky"]={description="Take your specified lucky item to the designated lucky spot, and good fortune will surely visit you...if Kurou-Morou the Magnificentaru speaks true.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=62,next={"Her Father's Legacy"},repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=4458,name="Goblin Bread"},{count=1,id=4539,name="Goblin Pie"},{count=1,name="Goblin Chocolate"}},reward="First time completion: 400 Cruor\nSubsequent completions: 200 Cruor\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Hands seals:\nUnkai Seal: Hands (SAM)\nCaller's Seal: Hands (SMN)\nEstoqueur's Seal: Hands (RDM)\nMavi Seal: Hands (BLU)",start_npc="Kurou-Morou (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Grauberg"},
["Gift of Light"]={description="Amaura has exhausted her supply of the key ingredient required to concoct a vital medication. Find and bring her the sunbeam fragment she needs before the survivors fall to illness!",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=1,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=1579,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Sunbeam fragment"}},reward="Hi-Reraiser\n120 Cruor",start_npc="Amaura, Abyssea",start_pos="E-3",start_zone="La Theine"},
["Hazy Prospects"]={description="An astute alchemist has concluded that the miasmas seeping up through fissures in the ground are contributing to the tainted air. Follow the recipe he entrusted to you to synthesize the counteragent, test it on a miasma, then report back with your findings.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="2",id=46,requirements={{count=1,name="Miasmal Counteragent"}},reward="[Key Item] Miasmal counteragent recipe\n[Key Item] Jade abyssite of lenity",start_npc="Harith, Abyssea",start_pos="G-10",start_zone="Attohwa"},
["Heart of Madness"]={description="You are the ray of hope for the people of Abyssea. Soldier on, if you would cast your light upon the truth which lies hidden within the depths of madness.",fame="Abyssea",id=169,next={"Tenuous Existence"},previous={"An Officer and a Pirate"},start_npc="Joachim",start_zone="Port Jeuno"},
["Help Not Wanted"]={description="A sniveling brat with an inferiority complex about never having graduated from military academy is too prideful to admit that he can't complete his mission on his own. Procure soul prints of the fiercest Abysseans for the ungrateful whelp.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=79,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,name="Soulgauger SGR-1\n\nBlank Gauger Plates\n\nGauger Plate"}},reward="First time completion: 650 Cruor\nSubsequent completions: 250~650 Cruor, depending on picture quality\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Hands seals:\nLancer's Seal: Hands (DRG)\nCirque Seal: Hands (PUP)\nCharis Seal: Hands (DNC)\nOrison Seal: Hands (WHM)",start_npc="Ken, Abyssea",start_pos="G-8",start_zone="Altepa"},
["Her Father's Legacy"]={description="For the survival of all those who call Grauberg home, Cornelia has assigned you the task of vanquishing the dread wyverns invariably seen in the company of the hydra Alfard.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=63,previous={"Getting Lucky"},repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=3267,name="Pursuer's Wing"}},reward="First time completion: 400 Cruor\nSubsequent completions: 200 Cruor\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Body seals:\nCreed Seal: Body (PLD)\nAoidos' Seal: Body (BRD)\nCaller's Seal: Body (SMN)\nCharis Seal: Body (DNC)\nTantra Seal: Body (MNK)",start_npc="Cornelia (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Grauberg"},
["Heroes of Abyssea"]={description="The poor souls stranded in Altepa, Uleguerand, and Grauberg face a constant struggle of simply subsisting in harsh climes. Yet cruel fate would also see them plagued by Abyssean horrors of unsurpassed ferocity. Help is direly needed if these beleaguered folk are to make it through the unending night.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=179,next={"Death and Rebirth"},previous={"Dawn of Death"},start_npc="Joachim",start_zone="Port Jeuno"},
["His Box, His Beloved"]={description="Apururu lacks for the starfruit needed to construct Cardians to protect her embattled countrymen. Travel to the northwestern encampment and procure one from the supply of the eccentric Kopuro-Popuro.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=20,next={"When Good Cardians Go Bad"},requirements={{count=1,id=1591,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Ripe starfruit"}},reward="200 Cruor",start_npc="Apururu, Abyssea",start_pos="H-12",start_zone="Tahrongi"},
["His Bridge, His Beloved"]={description="The bridges across the inlet are in a state of dire disrepair. Go repair them, that a sensitive woodworker's heart may again rest easy.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="2",id=32,repeatable="Yes",reward="First time completion: 800 Cruor, [Key Item] Crimson abyssite of lenity\nSubsequent completions: 150~850 Cruor\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Feet seals:\nAoidos' Seal: Feet (BRD)\nCreed Seal: Feet (PLD)\nMavi Seal: Feet (BLU)\nTantra Seal: Feet (MNK)",start_npc="Cheupirudaux, Abyssea",start_pos="E-7",start_zone="Vunkerl"},
["Home, Home on the Range"]={description="Bereft of hearth and home but not heart and hope, a beleaguered moogle has asked you to help him rebuild a small piece of his glory days.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="2",id=69,requirements={{count=1,name="[Key Item] Piece of sodden oak lumber\n\n[Key Item] Sodden linen cloth\n\n[Key Item] Dhorme khimaira's mane"}},reward="1,500 Cruor",start_npc="Moogle (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Uleguerand"},
["Hope Blooms on the Battlefield"]={description="The searing ward that serves as the last line of defense against the fell hordes of the highlands has suffered critical damage in an attack. Procure repair materials from throughout the base and deliver them to the engineer Raibaht before the fiends return!",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=10,next={"Of Malnourished Martellos"},reward="None",start_npc="Ayame (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Konschtat"},
["I Dream of Flowers"]={description="Perpetual pessimist Goraow wishes he had flowers to offer to the grave of his fallen brethren...",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=49,next={"Destiny Odyssey"},requirements={{count=1,id=956,name="Lilac"}},reward="800 Cruor",start_npc="Goraow (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Misareaux"},
["Imperial Espionage"]={description="A curious stranger from a distant land has tasked you with gathering information on the current state of the four nations of Altana.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="2",id=70,next={"Imperial Espionage II"},reward="1,000 Cruor",start_npc="Tyamah (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Uleguerand"},
["Imperial Espionage II"]={description="Stranded far from home and looking considerably worse for the wear, Tyamah has called upon your services again. Your mission, if you choose to accept it: use a soulgauger to gather intel on unfamiliar Abyssean fiends.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="3",id=71,previous={"Imperial Espionage"},requirements={{count=1,name="Soulgauger SGR-1\n\nBlank Gauger Plate\n\nGauger Plate"}},reward="1,800 Cruor\n[Key Item] Vermillion abyssite of avarice",start_npc="Tyamah (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Uleguerand"},
["Let There Be Light"]={description="Brother Zauko has entrusted you with a delivery of coal for the encampments, that the Divine Light of the Torch shall illuminate the realm now and forever.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=67,repeatable="Yes",reward="First time completion: 400 Cruor\nSubsequent completions: 200 Cruor\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Body seals:\nSavant's Seal: Body (SCH)\nCaller's Seal: Body (SMN)\nTantra Seal: Body (MNK)\nIga Seal: Body (NIN)\nLancer's Seal: Body (DRG)",start_npc="Zauko, Abyssea",start_pos="K-9",start_zone="Uleguerand"},
["Look Out Below"]={description="Baldric seeks to put an end to the avalanches that plague the survivors by triggering small explosions to disperse accumulated snow. Assist him in an experiment to determine the optimal quantity of firesand for the task.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=68,repeatable="Yes",reward="First time completion: 200-400 Cruor, depending on the accuracy of the mine payload. \nSubsequent completions: 100-200 Cruor\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Body seals:\nOrison Seal: Body (WHM)\nRaider's Seal: Body (THF)\nMavi Seal: Body (BLU)\nFerine Seal: Body (BST)\nSylvan Seal: Body (RNG)",start_npc="Baldric (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Uleguerand"},
["Look to the Sky"]={description="Finally at peace with the loss of her family, Alisa wishes you to bury her daughter Enu's favorite pendant in a spot as close to the sky as you can find. That's where the little girl would have wanted it...",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="5",id=83,previous={"Motherly Love"},requirements={{count=1,id=1761,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Moon pendant"}},reward="[Key Item] Emerald abyssite of expertise",start_npc="Alisa, Abyssea",start_pos="C-11",start_zone="Altepa"},
["Looking for Lookouts"]={description="A regiment of scouts has gone astray while on a mission to survey Parradamo Tor. Deliver linkpearls and emergency rations to the hapless crew and restore communication between them and their flustered commanding officer.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="2",id=40,repeatable="Yes",reward="400 Cruor\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Head seals:\nRavager Seal: Hd. (WAR)\nCaller's Seal: Hd. (SMN)\nCharis Seal: Hd. (DNC)\nSavant's Seal: Hd. (SCH)",start_npc="Colti, Abyssea",start_pos="H-8",start_zone="Attohwa"},
["Lost Memories"]={description="In order to brew a medicine that will restore Curilla's memory, Halver requires that you procure two lambent scales.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="5",id=9,next={"An Eye for Revenge"},repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=2,id=2874,name="Lambent Scale"}},reward="480 Cruor\nSubsequent completions:  Coeurl Mantle",start_npc="Halver, Abyssea",start_pos="L-11",start_zone="La Theine"},
["Master Missing, Master Missed"]={description="Eight of Clubs is gravely concerned for his master, whose return is long overdue. Travel to the location where the man was headed, that you might glean knowledge to set the Cardian's mind at rest.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="2",id=65,next={"The Perils of Kororo"},previous={"The Mysterious Head Patrol"},requirements={{count=1,id=1712,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Elegant gemstone"}},reward="800 Cruor",start_npc="Eight of Clubs, Abyssea",start_pos="H-8",start_zone="Grauberg"},
["Meanwhile, Back on Abyssea"]={description="Although the destructive will of the Twilight God is no more, the horrendous destruction wrought upon the land cannot be undone overnight. Yet now seeds of hope have been planted within the hearts of men...the hope that glory days shall once more return to Abyssea.",fame="Abyssea",id=185,next={"A Moonlight Requite"},previous={"The Wyrm God"}},
["Megadrile Menace"]={description="A giant worm thought long extinct has reemerged in Abyssea - Tahrongi, and now terrorizes those who have taken refuge in the canyon. Could this gargantuan beast be causing the recent destabilization of the boundary between worlds?",fame="Vision of Abyssia",id=165,reward="Lunar/Ivory abyssite, see chart below.",start_npc="Kocchi-Arocchi",start_zone="Tahrongi Canyon"},
["Missing in Action"]={description="A fierce attack by the Abyssean hordes has left some members of Iron Eater's regiment stranded afield. Without the means to regain contact nor the manpower to dispatch a search party, a lone hero must strike out into the wilderness and find them. That hero is you.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=48,reward="1,200 Cruor",start_npc="Iron Eater, Abyssea",start_pos="K-7",start_zone="Misareaux"},
["Motherly Love"]={description="Alisa's dear husband Zacc and lovely daughter Enu have not returned from their little stroll outside the searing ward. Whatever could be keeping them...?",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="4",id=82,next={"Look to the Sky"},requirements={{count=1,id=3243,name="Sabulous Clay"},{count=1,id=1761,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Moon pendant"}},reward="700 Cruor",start_npc="Alisa, Abyssea",start_pos="C-11",start_zone="Altepa"},
["Of Malnourished Martellos"]={description="The engineer overseeing martello maintenance has tasked you with replenishing the energy store of one of these curious magical structures. Acquire a supply of fuel, deposit it in the camp's martello, and report back when the operation is complete.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=11,next={"Refuel and Replenish (Konschtat)","Rose on the Heath"},previous={"Hope Blooms on the Battlefield"},start_npc="Raibaht, Abyssea",start_pos="I-13",start_zone="Konschtat"},
["Out of Touch"]={description="Glenne has lost the means to contact her husband who is out on patrol. Find her husband afield and deliver a new linkpearl to him.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="6",id=8,reward="1,000 Cruor\n[Key Item] Scarlet abyssite of kismet",start_npc="Glenne, Abyssea",start_pos="L-11",start_zone="La Theine"},
["Playing Paparazzi"]={description="Naji has grudgingly accepted you as his assistant, and entrusted you with continuing his work while his wounds keep him out of commission. Only close range shots of the most formidable foes to terrorize the highlands will suffice!",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="6",id=19,previous={"Secret Agent Man"},repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=1602,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Naji's linkpearl"},{count=1,id=18679,name="Soulgauger SGR-1"},{count=1,id=2480,name="Gauger Plate"}},reward="First time completion:\n[Key Item] Azure abyssite of merit\nSubsequent completions:\nBlack Mantle",start_npc="Naji, Abyssea",start_pos="J-5",start_zone="Konschtat"},
["Proof of the Lion"]={description="Excenmille, hero of the Crystal War, is disheartened by the lack of fortitude shown by his fellow survivors. Show to him that you are different by slaying the dread waugyl and returning with proof of your triumph.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=85,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=1764,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Waugyl's claw"}},reward="600 Cruor for first-time completion, 300 thereafter\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Body seals:\nGoetia Seal: Body (BLM)\nCharis Seal: Body (DNC)\nCreed Seal: Body (PLD)\nRaider's Seal: Body (THF)\nUnkai Seal: Body (NIN)",start_npc="Excenmille (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Altepa"},
["Refuel and Replenish (Altepa)"]={description="Regular replenishment of the martellos located throughout the Altepa Desert is vital to the resistance effort in this area. Refuel a martello and return the empty vat to the machine outfitter when your task is complete.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=148,repeatable="Yes",reward="Varying amount of Cruor depending on which Martello you choose.",start_npc="Machine Outfitter (Altepa), Abyssea",start_zone="Altepa"},
["Refuel and Replenish (Attohwa)"]={description="Regular replenishment of the martellos located throughout Attohwa Chasm is vital to the resistance effort in this area. Refuel a martello and return the empty vat to the machine outfitter when your task is complete.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=145,repeatable="Yes",reward="Varying amount of Cruor depending on which Martello you choose.",start_npc="Machine Outfitter (Attohwa), Abyssea",start_zone="Attohwa"},
["Refuel and Replenish (Grauberg)"]={description="Regular replenishment of the martellos located throughout Grauberg is vital to the resistance effort in this area. Refuel a martello and return the empty vat to the machine outfitter when your task is complete.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=150,repeatable="Yes",reward="Varying amount of Cruor depending on which Martello you choose.",start_npc="Machine Outfitter (Grauberg), Abyssea",start_zone="Grauberg"},
["Refuel and Replenish (Konschtat)"]={description="Regular replenishment of the martellos located throughout the Konschtat Highlands is vital to the resistance effort in this area. Refuel a martello and return the empty vat to the machine outfitter when your task is complete.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=143,previous={"Of Malnourished Martellos"},repeatable="Yes",reward="Varying amount of Cruor depending on which Martello you choose.",start_npc="Machine Outfitter (Konschtat), Abyssea",start_zone="Konschtat"},
["Refuel and Replenish (La Theine)"]={description="Regular replenishment of the martellos located throughout the La Theine Plateau is vital to the resistance effort in this area. Refuel a martello and return the empty vat to the machine outfitter when your task is complete.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=142,repeatable="Yes",reward="Varying amount of Cruor depending on which Martello you choose.",start_npc="Machine Outfitter (La Theine), Abyssea",start_zone="La Theine"},
["Refuel and Replenish (Misareaux)"]={description="Regular replenishment of the martellos located throughout the Misareaux Coast is vital to the resistance effort in this area. Refuel a martello and return the empty vat to the machine outfitter when your task is complete.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=146,repeatable="Yes",reward="Varying amount of Cruor depending on which Martello you choose.",start_npc="Machine Outfitter (Misareaux), Abyssea",start_zone="Misareaux"},
["Refuel and Replenish (Tahrongi)"]={description="Regular replenishment of the martellos located throughout the Tahrongi Canyon is vital to the resistance effort in this area. Refuel a martello and return the empty vat to the machine outfitter when your task is complete.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=144,next={"Cleansing the Canyon"},repeatable="Yes",reward="Varying amount of Cruor depending on which Martello you choose.",start_npc="Machine Outfitter (Tahrongi), Abyssea",start_zone="Tahrongi"},
["Refuel and Replenish (Uleguerand)"]={description="Regular replenishment of the martellos located throughout the Uleguerand Range is vital to the resistance effort in this area. Refuel a martello and return the empty vat to the machine outfitter when your task is complete.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=149,repeatable="Yes",reward="Varying amount of Cruor depending on which Martello you choose.",start_npc="Machine Outfitter (Uleguerand), Abyssea",start_zone="Uleguerand"},
["Refuel and Replenish (Vunkerl)"]={description="Regular replenishment of the martellos located throughout the Vunkerl Inlet is vital to the resistance effort in this area. Refuel a martello and return the empty vat to the machine outfitter when your task is complete.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=147,repeatable="Yes",reward="Varying amount of Cruor depending on which Martello you choose.",start_npc="Machine Outfitter (Vunkerl), Abyssea",start_zone="Vunkerl"},
["Rose on the Heath"]={description="The latest incursion of Abyssean fiends has left shattered linkshells in its wake, severing precious lines of communication between Captain Ayame and her comrades afield. Deliver three linkpearls, one each to Captains Rashid, Argus, and Helga, before an ill fate befalls these brave warriors of the resistance!",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=12,next={"Full-of-Himself Alchemist","Shady Business Redux","The Soul of the Matter"},previous={"Of Malnourished Martellos"},reward="400 Cruor",start_npc="Ayame, Abyssea",start_pos="I-13",start_zone="Konschtat"},
["Savory Salvation"]={description="A culinarian with serious delusions of grandeur sees himself as the savior of his nation's people. Employ the fertilizer he's given you on a suitable tree and bring back anything edible that may grow.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="2",id=23,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=1593,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Tahrongi tree nut"}},reward="200 Cruor",start_npc="Piketo-Puketo, Abyssea",start_pos="F-9",start_zone="Tahrongi"},
["Scars of Abyssea"]={description="Endless floods of Abyssean monsters are threatening to overwhelm military outposts in Vunkerl, Attohwa, and Misareaux. Lend your stout sword arm to the defense of the ever-vital pulse martellos, that hope may live on within the resistance effort!",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=175,next={"Death and Rebirth"},previous={"Dawn of Death"},start_npc="Joachim",start_zone="Port Jeuno"},
["Scattered Shells, Scattered Mind"]={description="The resistance's supply of linkshells has dwindled to dangerously low levels. Retrieve three from the field before your addle-minded client forgets just what exactly he asked you for.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="3",id=38,repeatable="Yes",reward="Black Earring /   Darkness Earring\nFirst time completion: 1,200 Cruor\nSubsequent completions: 600 Cruor\nChance at at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Feet seal.\nCirque Seal: Feet (PUP)\nEstoqueur's Seal: Feet (RDM)\nSylvan Seal: Feet (RNG)\nBale Seal: Feet (DRK)",start_npc="Aladoverre, Abyssea",start_pos="E-7",start_zone="Vunkerl"},
["Scouts Astray"]={description="Rondipur's incompetent underlings have managed to get themselves lost on a routine scouting mission. Find them before they meet an untimely end.",fame="Abyssea - Uleguerand",fame_level="2",id=74,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,name="Pea Soup or Emerald Soup\n\nFlint Stone"}},reward="First time completion: 800 Cruor \nSubsequent completions: 400 Cruor\nChance of one of the following:\nTantra Seal: Hands (MNK)\nSylvan Seal: Hands (RNG)\nCirque Seal: Hands (PUP)\nCreed Seal: Hands (PLD)",start_npc="Rondipur (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Uleguerand"},
["Secret Agent Man"]={description="Captain Helga fears for the safety of fellow officer and covert ops specialist Naji, who has not returned from his latest mission. The loss of this elite operative would be a near-fatal blow to the resistance. You must track him down with all haste!",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="6",id=18,next={"Playing Paparazzi"},previous={"The Soul of the Matter"},requirements={{count=1,id=1601,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Naji's gauger plate"}},reward="Evolith with random augment\n[Key Item] Naji's linkpearl",start_npc="Helga, Abyssea",start_pos="G-5",start_zone="Konschtat"},
["Shady Business Redux"]={description="The boss of the storehouse traders has made you a business proposition you couldn't refuse. Bring him four limule pincers to receive a handsome reward.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=15,previous={"Rose on the Heath"},repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=4,id=2889,name="Limule Pincer"}},reward="400 Cruor",start_npc="Talib, Abyssea",start_pos="D-7",start_zone="Konschtat"},
["Sisters in Crime"]={description="Holding out hope that their disreputable band may yet be reunited, the two lackeys of the Cat Burglar have co-opted you to spread the news of their survival. Affix the ridiculous posters they've given you to the signposts in the canyon.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="4",id=27,repeatable="Yes",reward="First time completion:\nWater Spider's Web x2\nSubsequent completions:\n400 Cruor",start_npc="Cha Lebagta and Bopa Greso, Abyssea",start_pos="I-10",start_zone="Tahrongi"},
["Slacking Subordinates"]={description="Chumimi's good-for-nothing assistants Chemioue, Biggorf, and Tapoh Lihzeh still haven't done their homework. Hunt them down and relay their findings to Chumimi by any means necessary.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=81,previous={"The Titus Touch"},repeatable="Yes",reward="First time completion: 400~500 Cruor\nSubsequent completions: 150~250 Cruor\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Body seals (ONLY if you do well with the quest):\nMavi Seal: Body (BLU)\nEstoqueur's Seal: Body (RDM) \nSylvan Seal: Body (RNG) \nCirque Seal: Body (PUP) \nRavager's Seal: Body (WAR)",start_npc="Chumimi, Abyssea",start_pos="G-7",start_zone="Altepa"},
["Slip Slidin' Away"]={description="The Resistance seeks to send a strike team into the bowels of Thousandfall Ridge, a confirmed breeding pit for the hordes. Help keep Michilca's men on course as they execute their hazardous approach.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="2",id=76,repeatable="Yes",reward="Resilient Mantle \nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Hands seals:\nAoidos' Seal: Hands\nEstoqueur's Seal: Hands\nRaider's Seal: Hands\nSavant's Seal: Hands",start_npc="Michilca (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Uleguerand"},
["Smoke over the Coast"]={description="Hungry Wolf hungers for meat! Hurry, before he transforms into a scrawny Hume before your very eyes!",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=53,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,name="Giant Sheep Meat"},{count=1,name="Galkan Sausage/+1/+2/+3"}},reward="200~600 Cruor, depending on quality of sausage. (double for first time completion) \nGuild Flyers (flyers on first completion only)\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Legs seals:\nCirque Seal: Legs (PUP)\nSylvan Seal: Legs (RNG)\nBale Seal: Legs (DRK)\nEstoqueur's Seal: Legs (RDM)",start_npc="Hungry Wolf, Abyssea",start_pos="G-7",start_zone="Misareaux"},
["Soil and Green"]={description="Sieglinde the alchemist is investigating soil quality along the coast, and has custom-designed a contraption for that purpose. Take the aptly named \"mineral gauge for dummies,\" and thrust it into a likely spot of earth by a tree.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="2",id=54,repeatable="Yes",reward="400 Cruor\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Hands seals:\nRavager's Seal: Legs (WAR)\nCaller's Seal: Legs (SMN)\nCharis Seal: Legs (DNC)\nSavant's Seal: Legs (SCH)",start_npc="Sieglinde (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Misareaux"},
["Something in the Air"]={description="The Professor is concerned about the air quality, and has hypothesized that the source of the pollution lies to the west. Go investigate, and bring back the tangible evidence that your client needs to formulate a solution to the crisis.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=44,next={"An Acrididaen Anodyne"},reward="Cura II (Scroll)",start_npc="Yoran-Oran, Abyssea",start_pos="G-10",start_zone="Attohwa"},
["Tangling with Tongue-twisters"]={description="Cuelebre. Adze. Minhocao. Chukwa. Mictlantecuhtli. No, this isn't the Federation spelling bee--these are the names of the five most formidable enemies plaguing the canyon. Slay one and bring back proof of your triumph.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="5",id=29,previous={"Cleansing the Canyon"},repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,name="[Key Item] Bloodied arrow (first time completion only)"},{count=1,name="[Key Item] Crimson bloodstone (subsequent completions only)"}},reward="First time completion:\nEvolith with random augments\nSubsequent completions:\n500 Cruor",start_npc="Kupipi, Abyssea",start_pos="H-12",start_zone="Tahrongi"},
["Tenuous Existence"]={description="Gilgamesh wishes to speak with you again, most likely regarding some grave matter. As before, make your way to the stone circle in the La Theine Plateau at a time between dusk and dawn.",fame="Abyssea",id=170,next={"Champions of Abyssea"},previous={"Heart of Madness","The Forbidden Frontier","Scars of Abyssea (Quest)","Heroes of Abyssea"},start_npc="Joachim",start_zone="Port Jeuno"},
["The Angling Armorer"]={description="With no end in sight in the fight against the Abyssean hordes, keeping soldiers outfitted in battle-worthy gear has become a grave concern. Could the ponds of La Theine yield old but usable equipment?",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=6,repeatable="Yes",reward="40 ~ 320 Cruor depending on the item turned in.",start_npc="Exoroche, Abyssea",start_pos="H-7",start_zone="La Theine"},
["The Beast of Bastore"]={description="A gargantuan beast identified as a ruszor has been terrorizing the embattled folk of Abyssea - Vunkerl. Will a hero arise to end the reign of this tusked terror?",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=172,next={"Heroes of Abyssea"},previous={"Dawn of Death"},reward="[Key Item] Lunar/Ivory Abyssite, see chart below.",start_npc="Moniquaurie",start_zone="Jugner Forest"},
["The Boxwatcher's Behest"]={description="Supplies must be delivered on foot to the newly constructed outpost, and the sluggardly Deraquien is clearly not up to the task. Go in his stead and deliver the goods to Captain Elmemague.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=31,repeatable="Yes",reward="First time completion: 300~1,500 Cruor, 10~70 Resistance Credits\nSubsequent completions: 225~1,125 Cruor, 10~70 Resistance Credits\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Feet seals:\nRavager's Seal: Feet (WAR)\nCaller's Seal: Feet (SMN)\nCharis Seal: Feet (DNC)\nSavant's Seal: Feet (SCH)",start_npc="Deraquien, Abyssea",start_pos="F-4",start_zone="Vunkerl"},
["The Egg Enthusiast"]={description="Ranpi-Monpi, culinarian extraordinaire, requires that you bring a fresh wivre egg from within the nesting grounds. Take extra care that the fragile egg is not damaged during transportation.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=61,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=1713,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Wivre egg"}},reward="Dependent on which Earthy Mound you go to.\nFirst time completion: 200~400 Cruor\nSubsequent completions: 100~200 Cruor\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Body seals:\nGoetia Seal: Body (BLM)\nEstoqueur's Seal: Body (RDM)\nIga Seal: Body (NIN)\nUnkai Seal: Body (SAM)\nLancer's Seal: Body (DRG)",start_npc="Ranpi-Monpi (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Grauberg"},
["The Forbidden Frontier"]={description="Fierce battles rage across the disfigured landscape of Abyssea. Will you be the glimmer of hope for the survival of mankind?",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=166,next={"Death and Rebirth"},previous={"Dawn of Death"},start_npc="Joachim",start_zone="Port Jeuno"},
["The Mysterious Head Patrol"]={description="Who is the mystery person who patrols the head of Eight of Hearts? Find a vertically challenged individual attired in yellow who possesses a silver pocket watch, and you will find the answer.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="2",id=64,next={"Master Missing, Master Missed"},requirements={{count=1,id=1711,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Silver pocket watch"}},reward="400 Cruor",start_npc="Eight of Hearts, Abyssea",start_pos="H-13",start_zone="Grauberg"},
["The Perils of Kororo"]={description="Caring young Kororo cannot help but worry about Eight of Clubs' state of mind. Be a dear and check up on the Cardian in her stead.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="2",id=66,previous={"Master Missing, Master Missed"},reward="1,200 Cruor",start_npc="Kororo, Abyssea",start_pos="H-13",start_zone="Grauberg"},
["The Secret Ingredient"]={description="Bean chef extraordinaire Nogelle lost her entire supply of Lufet lake salt in her escape from San d'Oria. Seek out a substitute ingredient, that she might put fire in the bellies of her fellow survivors with a piping pot of bean stew.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=78,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=2976,name="Badlands Salt"}},reward="First time completion: 400 Cruor\nSubsequent completions: 200 Cruor\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Hands seals:\nTantra Seal: Hands (MNK)\nSylvan Seal: Hands (RNG)\nUnkai Seal: Hands (SAM)\nNavarch's Seal: Hands (COR)",start_npc="Nogelle, Abyssea",start_pos="K-5",start_zone="Altepa"},
["The Soul of the Matter"]={description="A reconnaissance expert has taken you under his wing to tutor you in the arcane art of soulgauging. Venture afield with your Soulgauger SGR-1 and collect intelligence on the notorious fiends aprowl in the vicinity.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=17,next={"Secret Agent Man"},previous={"Rose on the Heath"},repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=18679,name="Soulgauger SGR-1"},{count=1,id=2480,name="Gauger Plate"}},reward="First time completion:\n400~520 Cruor\nBehemoth Ring  \nSubsequent completions:\n200~260 Cruor",start_npc="Cleades, Abyssea",start_pos="G-5",start_zone="Konschtat"},
["The Titus Touch"]={description="Alchemical genius Titus is at it again, his latest masterful creation being...ink. Deliver this practical (if not particularly exciting) product to medic team leader Chumimi at the first outpost, that she might complete her report.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=80,next={"Slacking Subordinates"},requirements={{count=1,name="Windurstian Tea Leaves"}},reward="500 Cruor",start_npc="Titus, Abyssea",start_pos="G-11",start_zone="Altepa"},
["The Truth Beckons"]={description="What is this phenomenon called \"noise\" of which Joachim speaks? If you would learn the truth, take the traverser stone and visit a cavernous maw that has been freed from its frozen state.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=161,next={"Dawn of Death"},previous={"A Journey Begins"},start_npc="Joachim",start_zone="Port Jeuno"},
["The Unmarked Tomb"]={description="Doctor Oiheaurese, an authority on wyverns, has heard reports that a living wyvern egg lies buried beneath the shifting sands of Altepa. Can this elusive treasure be found...?",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="6",id=84,requirements={{count=1,name="[Key Item] Wyvern egg\n\n[Key Item] Wyvern egg shell"}},reward="[Key Item] Emerald abyssite of lenity\n1,200 Cruor",start_npc="Oiheaurese, Abyssea",start_pos="G-7",start_zone="Altepa"},
["The Walking Wounded"]={description="Five of Captain Rashid's best soldiers are battling bravely despite grievous wounds. Provide each of them with a soothing potion to restore them to fighting trim.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="4",id=14,previous={"Full-of-Himself Alchemist"},repeatable="Yes",reward="First time completion:\nEvolith with random stats\nSubsequent completions:\n600 Cruor",start_npc="Rashid, Abyssea",start_pos="F-10",start_zone="Konschtat"},
["The Wyrm God"]={description="Prishe, the sole survivor of mankind's ill-fated confrontation with Promathia, speaks of the Twilight God's transformation into a fearsome embodiment of terror and dread. The final battle is at hand, and the stakes are high: the very survival of Abyssea!",fame="Abyssea",id=184,next={"Meanwhile, Back on Abyssea"},previous={"Beneath a Blood-red Sky"},start_npc="Prishe, Abyssea",start_zone="Empyreal Paradox"},
["Threadbare Tribulations"]={description="A tailor seeks to raise morale by mending the garments of the soldiers, but lacks for the thread she needs to perform the task. Bring her the three amoeban pseudopods that she insists will serve as an ideal substitute.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=42,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=3,id=2641,name="Amoeban Pseudopod"}},reward="200 Cruor\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Feet seals\nOrison Seal: Head (WHM)\nRaider's Seal: Head (THF)\nFerine Seal: Head (BST)\nUnkai Seal: Head (SAM)",start_npc="Ponono, Abyssea",start_pos="H-7",start_zone="Attohwa"},
["To Paste a Peiste"]={description="A grossly oversized, mutated subspecies of peiste has been wreaking havoc upon the folk of Abyssea - Konschtat. Remove the fangs of this foul fiend, that tomorrow might be a better day.",fame="Vision of Abyssia",id=164,reward="Lunar/Ivory abyssite, see chart below.",start_npc="Norrah",start_zone="Konschtat Highlands"},
["Unbreak His Heart"]={description="A fishing rod lies broken. You must repair and deliver it to Gallijaux at the southeastern encampment lest the survivors go hungry.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=4,repeatable="Yes",reward="120 Cruor",start_npc="Joulet, Abyssea",start_pos="H-7",start_zone="La Theine"},
["Unidentified Research Object"]={description="Yurim requires a certain object in order to continue her research on Abyssean lifeforms, but is experiencing difficulties remembering its name...",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=51,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,name="Murex Spicule\nOptional: Apple Pie / Apple Pie +1"}},reward="800 Cruor, 400 Cruor for repeat completions\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Legs seals:\nTantra Seal: Legs (MNK)\nAoidos' Seal: Legs (BRD) \nMavi Seal: Legs (BLU) \nCreed Seal: Legs (PLD)",start_npc="Yurim (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Misareaux"},
["Voices from Beyond"]={description="Rumors abound of ghosts haunting the mountains to the northwest. Rukususu requires that you bring irrefutable proof to substantiate this disturbing tale.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="3",id=57,next={"Benevolence Lost"},repeatable="No",requirements={{count=1,id=3269,name="Decaying Molar"},{count=1,id=3315,name="Ominous Skull"}},reward="[Key Item] Indigo abyssite of lenity",start_npc="Rukususu (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Grauberg"},
["Wanted: Medical Supplies"]={description="The struggle against the Abyssean invaders grows ever fierce. To do your part, you must bring Yasuji any medical supplies you find within sturdy pyxides. For make benefit the great resistance effort, let us together!",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="2",id=56,repeatable="Yes",requirements={{count=1,id=1635,ki=true,name="[Key Item] Medical supply chest"}},reward="[Key Item] Sapphire abyssite of merit\n800 Cruor\nChance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Legs seals:\nGoetia Seal: Legs (BLM)\nLancer's Seal: Legs (DRG)\nIga Seal: Legs (NIN)\nNavarch's Seal: Legs (COR)",start_npc="Yasuji (A), Abyssea",start_zone="Misareaux"},
["Ward Warden I (Attohwa)"]={description="It is imperative that the pulse martello and the clone wards are kept in prime condition. This operation requires you to transport the necessary repair materials from the stockpile, using the enchanted sack provided. Be mindful that the sack does not rupture in the process.",fame="Abyssea",fame_level="1",id=124,repeatable="Yes",reward="Varying amount of Cruor (Max: 1,000) and Resistance Credits (Max: 70)\n0~1 of: any Empyrean Armor +1 Head seal",start_npc="Resistance Sapper, Abyssea",start_pos="F-9",start_zone="Attohwa"},
